playlist-checker (1.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A single click on a channel's stream address (shown with ▶, hand cursor)
    plays it; double-click, Enter and right-click -> Play still work.
  * Settings -> Video player: Automatic, VLC, mpv, Celluloid, SMPlayer,
    GNOME Videos, ffplay, the system default app for playlists, or a custom
    command ({url} {name} {ua} {referer}). The channel's User-Agent and
    Referer are passed to the player. Options: single click plays, close
    the previous player when playing another channel.
  * Without any known player the stream is opened through a one-channel
    .m3u with the default app instead of the web browser, and a missing
    chosen player is reported with the install command.

