playlist-checker (1.4.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: after all streams were checked ("Checking N / N") the program
    seemed to hang while it took pictures for the banner check. The picture
    phase is now much faster (about 10x on provider streams): only the
    lowest-quality HLS stream and its newest segment are used instead of all
    qualities, the same address is pictured once, more pictures run in
    parallel and each has a shorter time limit.
  * The status bar shows the picture phase with progress and time left, and
    the Stop button becomes "Skip pictures", which keeps all stream results.

