playlist-checker (1.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New status "Geo-blocked" for channels that only show "not available in
    your country": detected from HTTP 451, 403 / web pages mentioning the
    country or region (English, Russian, Ukrainian, Hebrew), redirects to
    "geoblock" addresses, and short looping videos instead of live TV.
  * Picture check with ffmpeg: a fingerprint of one frame per channel; when
    several channels show the same picture the program shows it and asks.
    Right-click -> "Mark as geo-blocked" teaches a banner, which is then
    recognised on all channels (also in later checks); "Not geo-blocked"
    undoes it. Settings -> Detect geo-blocked channels; Check -> Find "not
    available" banners in online channels.
  * Geo-blocked channels are left out when saving (option), can be shown
    with Show -> Geo-blocked, removed from the list, and are rechecked by
    Recheck offline. ffmpeg is now a recommended package.

